    "ClientGatewayUnavailable is translated with its original cause; the same exception class raised during payloadlookup outside the tryblock propagates unchanged.",
    "The missingcurrency key is lookedup before booleanamount validation, so that controlled combination raisesKeyError.",
    "ThreeUnicodecodepoints taking sevenUTF8bytes and a negativeamount are accepted; an integersubclass is rejected by the exactbuiltinint check.",
    "Negative timeout, emptytoken and querycharacter account are forwarded as written to the fake; no concrete HTTP/deadline/authorization semantics are inferred.",
    "The calleraccount is retained even if the payload contains anotheraccount; arbitrarylarge builtinint values are not rangechecked."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "One instrumented synthetic composition is not production wiring, HTTP traffic, TLS, real authorization or a network deadline.",
    "One adapter-level fake call says nothing about a missing concrete client internal retry/cache/persistence policy.",
    "Diagram self-arrows are source-level internal actions; compare only the six observable cross-component edges on the normal path.",
    "These are additional execution probes, not another run of the prior eight source tests or a change to the278documentation unit-test count.",
